{"case_id": "female_19800921_P007-Q31", "domain": "study", "question": "命主的学历状况如何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主丁火生于酉月，金旺火弱，但年柱庚申、月柱乙酉、时柱乙巳，其中时支巳火为丁火之根，且乙木印星透干生身，形成“印星护身”之象。印星代表学业、文化，乙木双透，且巳中藏丙火劫财帮身，说明命主有学习能力和上进心。但月令酉金为偏财，财星旺而克印，早年学业可能受家庭或经济因素影响，但时柱乙巳印星得地，中年后学业或进修机会增多。综合看，命主至少能完成专科以上教育，且印星有力，有深造可能，但财旺印弱，博士学位需极大努力，可能性较低。因此最符合的是专科毕业。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "female_19800921_P007-Q31", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4060, "response_id": "1bf43fa3-96e6-4b55-9f9d-95313a227231", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 205, "completion_tokens": 188, "total_tokens": 393, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 205}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
